name: Seed Ideas
description: Fan out N genuinely distinct idea directions along an axis you name — each idea its own cell.
  Guided by the seed-ideas judgment skill.
tags:
- seed-ideas
prompt: Run the seed-ideas skill on the axis this cell's files name — fan out several genuinely distinct directions
  along it and develop each one into its own cell.
settings:
  agent-config.set_yaml:
    surface: annotation
    session: oneshot
    backend: pydantic-ai
    system_prompt: ''
    mcp: 'off'
    approvals: auto
    selected_file_first: false
folders:
- _skills
accounts: {}
permissions:
  docker: none
  internet: full
  commands: deny
packages: {}
